{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1201627-if-you-were-in-mage","id":1201627,"title":"If you were in Mage...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-31T08:32:40-07:00","id":1201627,"title":"If you were in Mage...","content":"The World of Darkness can be seen as a parallel counterpart to the world we reside in currently. It has a history of which parallels key events in ours. Even if there are discrepancies between how exactly the metaplot was carried out, a lot of the big events in our history still happened in Mage history.<br /> <br /> e.g. Even if it's not quite cleared up whether the nazi's were controlled by technocrats, nephandic forces, or simply just sleepers making a big deal on their own, we can all agree that WW2 happened.<br /> <br /> Now, imagine yourself in the mage setting. I mean that literally, imagine you as you are now with all the key events that played out in your life, but in the world of mage. Not the person you would play, nor the person that you would chose to be if the mage universe were real, but the person you are now with your current outlook and experiences.<br /> Who would this mage parallel of yourself be?<br /> <br /> Would they have awakened, if so then what point in your real life would be your Mage parallel's awakening moment? Are there people in your life that resemble certain factions in mage?<br /> Would you be a technocrat? What kind? Which level? And how indoctrinated do you think your Mage parallel would be?<br /> Perhaps a sorcerer or a englightened citizen? Or maybe just a sleeper. But don't leave it at that, explain why you think your Mage Parallel has remained unawakened, and what drew them to the arts, or kept them looking down.<br /> <br /> Would you have even become a member of the fallen. This doesn't mean you yourself are evil, but that you know that there are moments in your life that, had the Mage rule of the universe been in effect where all things are subjective if there is enough belief, that the nature of reality would mean less and less, and that someone might even push you over the edge.<br /> <br /> NOTE: These parallels are not necessarily the same as you, they might be more extreme or a bit more exaggerated. Also, try to avoid getting too judgy about other people. Ask questions sure, but don't abuse.<br /> <br /> My Mage Parallel would definitely be a Progenitor. I was very easily indoctrinated into the technocratic paradigm from a young age. Though my family had links with the Verbena, the Union's slow indoctrination over my years at university made me question the validity of their techniques until I grew to reject them entirely in favour of the technocratic ideal. I became enlightened part way through my Masters during the act of writing my dissertation, as I consumed the vast reach of knowledge that other progenitors had provided, and everything seemed to click into place. Since then I started a PhD and have been gaining loyalty and notoriety within the union ever since.<br /> <br /> My indoctrination is almost complete, and though I still have connections with the verbena relatives of my past, I don't talk about them within the union, and would be quick to point out how damaging such techniques actually are to humanity. I spend most of my time in the lab, but would very much like to continue up the ladder of academia.<br /> If I was asked to come into conflict with the verbena regarding medicine, I would, even if it means suppressing members of my own family. That's how indoctrinated I would be.<br /> I'd have a long future in the union with my Syndicate wife, an emerging financial engineer. We would be well cared for, so long as we continued to contribute to the needs of the union, even if that means living apart for the majority of our marriage to attend to Union duties.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T09:12:52-07:00","id":1201645,"title":"","content":"I would be a virtual adept. My early influences were a couple, a Verbanea witch and her mystically inclined Virtual Adept husband. Warren was everything I wanted to be when I grew up, but we moved away and I lost touch with them. It'd be another two decades before I awoke myself.<br /> <br /> My awakening would have been about four years ago, during a particular crisis of identity in which my different personas (some virtual, some physical) collapsed. Separate enough that the had their own names and personalities, and those who knew me by one name would hardly have recognized the others. I won't go into too much detail (it's very personal), but I'd have ended up with a strong avatar, a willful entity that pushed me to integrate my different aspects and become something better than before. Reality is flexible and identity is what we make of it. Reality Hacking for a practice, and It\u2019s All Good \u2013 Have Faith! for a paradigm. My avatar still pushes me from time to time when I fall into a rut and stop growing.<br /> <br /> My job at the time was a sleeper company, but the new CTO was definitely Iteration X. He tried to recruit me, but my awakening did not lend itself well to the technocratic paradigm - we had a rather public parting of ways over his desire to use our technology for surveillance, and I left the company in a rather dramatic fashion (this is all true, not even exaggerated). If we were both enlightened, he might very well have attempted to bring me in by force for 'reeducation' - in the real world, instead I simply quit the job with 1-day notice.<br /> <br /> My current partner would be a sleeper, but fitful, showing signs of perhaps awakening in the future. If so, I expect she'll either be a Virtual Adept or a member of the Cult of Ecstasy - either way, with Tech Holds All the Answers for a paradigm and Cybernetics for a focus (yes, Cult with cybernetics is strange, but there have been weirder things in Mage!).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9510-bluewinds","name":"BlueWinds","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9510_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"554"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T09:36:12-07:00","id":1201650,"title":"","content":"Heh, I would like to believe that I would have Awoken to the power of magic from a very young age. Or if that were not the case, then I'd probably have been merged with a Changeling at some point. I have always been fascinated by the occult, and in my youth, I was a true believer in the supernatural. I wasn't just playing pretend when I made imaginary friends, focused psychic abilities or tried to brew alchemical potions by throwing a bunch of random ingredients together. In my mind, it was all real, even if my bodily senses tried to tell me otherwise. So going by the mechanics of this world in which belief plays a large role in being able to wield magic, I'm confident that my Awakening would have happened.<br /> <br /> <br /> That being said, however, I'm reasonably certain that I would have ended up becoming a Marauder, if for no other reason than the fact that I loathe the idea of a world without magic. Even if I've lost that spark of true belief that I had as a child, there is still a part of me now that clings to the hope that it actually could be real and I just haven't found it, yet. I'm 30 years old, by the way, which should tell you how important this was / is for me.<br /> <br /> So yeah, telling the Technocracy and Consensus to go blow themselves while I run around performing magic to my heart's content is definitely something that I could imagine myself doing in this world. I probably wouldn't be overly concerned if others get hurt in the process because, as far as I'm aware, I can warp reality. And if I can warp reality, then that means I don't have to worry about consequences for my actions.<br /> <br /> Somebody gets accidentally hurt or killed around me? No problem, we'll just use a spell to fix it. They'll be back on their feet within the hour! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Magic can't solve all your problems. There are rules you have to follow.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Uhhhh, if I can <b>'warp reality'</b> by believing really hard, then yes it can and no there aren't. I'm technically omnipotent, which means I'm the one who makes the rules!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T17:26:42-07:00","id":1201755,"title":"","content":"Greetings.<br /> <br /> Interesting topic <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I would be either a Virtual Adepts or an Etherite (moslty the second...). I have a deep interest since childhood for science in general, combined with an everlasting interest for everything that touch science-fiction.<br /> <br /> In real life, I just recently became a chemical engineer (who said passion for sci-fi cannot initiates careers <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ). So professionally I'm also into it (science).<br /> <br /> Why the Traditions and not the Technocracy ? I need freedom and flexibility. The way I perceive the Technocracy is a large organization that focus on micromanagement, profits and control. It fails to provide the purpose I identify with.<br /> <br /> I see myself experimenting new ways of doing science in a secret family owned factory, deep into the country, with a statue of a frowning Nicola Tesla in the middle of the room. My main goal would be finding new ways to improve mankind through science (or to apply it to Mage: through creative freedom)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23871,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23871-grimes","user":"Grimes","date":". 03-31-2018, 08:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23871-grimes","name":"Grimes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23871_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T18:01:29-07:00","id":1201771,"title":"","content":"Prior military. Decent shape. Semi-intelligent. Fan of firearms(and archery). <br /> <br /> I'd make good slushi and turned into a H.I.T. Mark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T18:56:27-07:00","id":1201794,"title":"","content":"An amateur Tarot reader, but expanded significantly due to being in Mage world, with dabbling in technomancy thanks to not seeing the difference between tech and sorcery. Sounds like an eclectic sorcerer, but is there an Awakened group who fits this description?<br /> <br /> EDIT: On the other hand, my background and current studies point me strongly to the New World Order and/or the Syndicate...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 03-31-2018, 09:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-31T20:12:51-07:00","id":1201831,"title":"","content":"It's the World of Darkness, so being a history major as an undergraduate and suffering from sleep apnea, I'd have been strung along and used by the Progenitors as a Quintessence battery. The Syndicate would decide how long I got to live.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T15:51:45-07:00","id":1202321,"title":"","content":"Either a Progenitor or a Son of Ether mad scientist focused on the biological.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T17:16:07-07:00","id":1202359,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar95_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"95\" data-vbnamecard=\"95\">Fat Larry</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13680_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13680\" data-vbnamecard=\"13680\">baakyocalder</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3598_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3598\" data-vbnamecard=\"3598\">CajunKhan</a> <br /> <br /> Care to elaborate a little bit further on what you've already stated?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T17:44:32-07:00","id":1202374,"title":"","content":"I'm a Cajun from the most backwoods part of a tiny backwoods town. Technically my life story would lend itself to being a Celestial Chorister or Verbena, but I rejected those sorts of beliefs utterly by the time I was 12. So unless the Awakening happened very early in my life, I'd be a sci-fi guy. Loved Doctor Who, loved Star Trek, loved Bradbury, loved science. To the degree that I'm not a science guy, I'm rather macabre, with a great love for monsters. I also have several medical problems that would push me towards fixing them. I would want to fix myself and make monsters. That screams Progenitor, or the sort of Son of Ether that is virtually a Progenitor with more lightning and gothic architecture.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-02T19:56:39-07:00","id":1202410,"title":"","content":"I major in politics and economics, is studying to become a government official, and is an amateur cartomancer who for some reason can only read how and why the querent will fail and suffer in the future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T06:29:06-07:00","id":1202539,"title":"","content":"So, the Technocracy has been pushing this narrative for a while now that most Sons of Ether are just Technocrats who couldn't cut it. Obviously, that's rarely the case, but it would be for me. I would be a bitter, narcissistic Void Engineer-wannabe who turned to the Etherites out of a mix of spite and egotistical refusal to play by someone else's rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Never not tired","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12001-the-nilbog","name":"The Nilbog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T07:47:45-07:00","id":1202580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1201627-if-you-were-in-mage?p=1202359#post1202359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar95_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"95\" data-vbnamecard=\"95\">Fat Larry</a><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13680_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13680\" data-vbnamecard=\"13680\">baakyocalder</a><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3598_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3598\" data-vbnamecard=\"3598\">CajunKhan</a><br /> <br /> Care to elaborate a little bit further on what you've already stated?</div> </div> </div> </div>Simply put, there is little room in the World of Darkness for people who cannot be made into little Technocratic minions or who are powerful rebels. I was also trying to remind everyone that while it is nice imaging ourselves as mages, most of us would be Sleepers. Sleepers without skills that are valued are used as fuel by the Syndicate. So, a person with a humanities degree struggles to get work. They'd work a series of lousy jobs and lose their Quintessence bit by bit until no longer worth keeping alive.<br /> <br /> If I was a mage, I'd probably be a New World Order guy trying to get people to see history differently and end up getting whacked by Pentex as I got too much into making the world better by changing views on the environment. Or, I'd be a low-level associate stuck with the knowledge that reality can be altered, but miserable because I couldn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T14:01:20-07:00","id":1202723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>baakyocalder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1201627-if-you-were-in-mage?p=1202580#post1202580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Simply put, there is little room in the World of Darkness for people who cannot be made into little Technocratic minions or who are powerful rebels. I was also trying to remind everyone that while it is nice imaging ourselves as mages, most of us would be Sleepers. Sleepers without skills that are valued are used as fuel by the Syndicate. So, a person with a humanities degree struggles to get work. They'd work a series of lousy jobs and lose their Quintessence bit by bit until no longer worth keeping alive.<br /> <br /> If I was a mage, I'd probably be a New World Order guy trying to get people to see history differently and end up getting whacked by Pentex as I got too much into making the world better by changing views on the environment. Or, I'd be a low-level associate stuck with the knowledge that reality can be altered, but miserable because I couldn't.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you were NWO, you'd have their protection. The Union looks after its own, especially if it means not having to expend extra resources training someone new. clones are only good for so much you see.<br /> <br /> Also, if you were a sleeper, that's still a point of interest. What kind of reality zone would you live in? What kind of consensus would you be contributing to, and what kind of magic would be coincidental around you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-05T11:22:56-07:00","id":1203463,"title":"","content":"Well if I was a sleeper, there really isn't much to discuss, because life for sleepers isn't much different than it is in the real world. Day to day life is slightly worse, but not to the point of being unrecognizable. There is tiny chance that a supernatural creature will eat you or turn you into a lawn-chair, but that chance is so low percentagewise that most people don't even notice. So I guess I just slog on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}